# Your Crystal Ball (jeuno 9), GM-set: accepted at Prog 1 with a Divination Sphere given. The sphere to Kurou-Morou:
# :57 Prog is not 2, so the trade arm fails on its Prog operand alone (nil, the sphere kept).
lists LowerJeuno/Kurou-Morou/onTrade
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-1,-6.7,-29 job=WAR lvl=30
quest Jeuno.YourCrystalBall accepted
charvar Quest[3][9]Prog 1
item DivinationSphere
login
walk -2.5,-6.7,-28
trade Kurou-Morou DivinationSphere x1       # Prog 1, the sphere: nil
